I reached the office.
I opened the door.
There is AC in the office.
It is very cool here.
Prakash is there.
"Good morning, Prakash," I said.
"Good morning, Maya," Prakash said.
"Today it is extremely hot outside," Prakash said.
"Yes, today it is very sunny," I said.
"But it will rain today," I told Prakash.
"Will it rain?"
Prakash asked.
"Really?"
"Yes, it shows like that on the app," I said.
"It will rain in the evening."
"That is a big relief," Prakash said.
We started working.
